Subject: CPMS I03E3 Proof Oracle and Review Protocol Source
Description: Manager-derived source for independent expectation authority, claim and coverage review, Honesty-Security cross-confirmation, preserved dissent, and Observer corpus-admission decisions over exact I03E2 proposals. Formation creates no reviewed case, signature, reader execution, or compatibility authority.

@ [source_uuid] cac5fb29-0dc6-40ae-b17b-ce3cf91d600a
@ [recorded_at_utc] 2026-08-05
@ [baseline_commit] 181e1c554e7b4b263671f579c1d71bc7eb0622dc
@ [parent_i03e_uuid] b13ea7b3-0ff6-4fcc-aed3-3eaec4a786c5
@ [proposal_catalogue_uuid] f39669f2-a912-44df-be42-1269f32bc82b

& [Purpose] is break self-confirming evidence loops
  + generator proposes a case but cannot authorize its expectation
  + implementation under test emits an observation but cannot define what should have happened
  + comparator classifies actual against reviewed expectation but cannot rewrite either
  + admission reviews exact receipts and cannot manufacture missing proof

& [IndependenceAxes] are explicit
  + generation independence separates case construction from expectation authority
  + execution independence separates expected result from actual reader path
  + comparison independence preserves both inputs before classification
  + review independence records reviewer identity source basis conflicts and dissent
  + lineage independence prevents one digest from being called a second signature

& [ExpectationSource] is plain articulated meaning
  + exact case identity payload digest root direction operator lineage targeted obligations and proposed claims
  + expected ingress schema typed semantic and comparison dispositions
  + exact rule rationale using canonical schemas Rust types ingress contracts and residual records
  + boundary arithmetic uses exact integers tokens bytes or scalar counts and never f64 approximation
  + an observed implementation result may trigger review but cannot be copied into expectation without independent justification

& [OracleClasses] are stage specific
  + byte oracle cites exact spans JSON grammar duplicate decoded identity and resource arithmetic
  + schema oracle cites canonical rule sites CommonSyntaxClaim schema witness and Draft 2020-12 semantics
  + typed oracle cites Rust type source serde attributes direction constructibility and destination representation
  + semantic oracle cites exact safe_pure function contract complete fixture relation and independently prepared vector or proof
  + authority oracle proves prohibited behavior was not invoked and never returns semantic admission

& [CaseExpectationReceipt] binds exact reviewed expectations
  + separate result for ingress schema typed semantic comparison and overall case applicability
  + rationale references immutable source clauses and arithmetic or construction proof
  + reviewer acceptance is not a runtime observation

& [ClaimWitnessReceipt] reviews each CommonSyntaxClaim
  + claim proposition is meaningful for the root and direction
  + schema witness and typed witness actually address the same proposition
  + expected accepted or rejected disposition is justified independently for both
  + not_comparable is preferred to an invented shared claim

& [CoverageMappingReceipt] reviews obligation edges
  + each case-to-obligation edge identifies the exact behavior that supplies evidence
  + one case can cover multiple obligations only through individually reviewable edges
  + template similarity or shared bytes do not create root coverage automatically
  + remaining gaps stay visible

& [HonestyReviewReceipt] guards identity and claim truth
  + verifies case payload identity expectation-source independence claim meaning expected-versus-observed separation and scope wording
  + refuses false agreement finite-to-exhaustive inference semantic-to-authority inference and digest-as-signature language

& [SecurityReviewReceipt] guards boundary and execution safety
  + verifies carrier preconditions resource bounds malformed payload containment immutable schemas no-resolution no ambient effect and prohibited-authority non-invocation
  + refuses hidden layer conversion bypass unsafe fixture construction or scope expansion

& [CrossConfirmation] requires both faculties without collapsing them
  + Honesty signs its receipt and references the exact Security receipt identity it inspected
  + Security signs its receipt and references the exact Honesty receipt identity it inspected
  + Observer verifies the pair forms one closed mutual-reference envelope without circular self-digest
  + neither receipt can authorize the other faculty's conclusion

& [CrossEnvelope] avoids digest recursion
  + form HonestyPayload and SecurityPayload independently without peer digest
  + compute both payload digests
  + form CrossConfirmationEnvelope over both payload digests each faculty disposition and reviewer identities
  + cryptographic signatures if later configured sign the envelope digest rather than embedding mutually recursive signatures
  + a content digest CRC or checksum is integrity identity and never impersonates a signature

& [Dissent] is durable first-class evidence
  + reviewer can affirm challenge abstain or mark insufficient_evidence
  + challenge owns exact case claim edge clause rationale severity and proposed resolution
  + open challenge or insufficient evidence blocks admission for the affected subject
  + resolution creates a successor record and never deletes the original dissent

& [ReviewSuccessorRules] preserve causality
  + payload operator parameter or fixture change creates a new case successor and invalidates prior case receipts
  + expectation claim witness obligation mapping or rationale change creates a receipt successor
  + reviewer identity or source-basis change creates a new review receipt
  + resolved dissent references both predecessor dissent and exact corrective successor

& [BatchReview] reduces repetition without sampling authority
  + one batch may share rationale only across exact listed case digests with identical operator mapping expectation class and source basis
  + every case still owns a receipt edge and can carry an exception
  + spot checking or statistical sampling cannot admit unreviewed cases
  + batch change invalidates every dependent edge

& [FacultyCycle] is ordered
  * Scribe verifies immutable payload provenance and complete references
  * Refiner verifies one-change lineage identity distinctions and normalized form
  * Weaver verifies claims obligations residual and root-direction mappings
  * Planner verifies prerequisite order constructibility and complete review queue
  * Honesty and Security review independently then cross-confirm
  * Observer verifies all receipts dissent closure resource accounts and authority boundary
  + faculty output is review evidence rather than hidden chain-of-thought

& [ObserverDisposition] is review_not_ready review_refused or corpus_candidate_formed
  + corpus_candidate_formed requires every proposed admitted case exact receipts cross-envelope and zero unresolved blockers
  + it remains a candidate and does not authorize reader execution
  + execution activation requires separate satisfaction signature and phase lock

& [ModelAssistanceBoundary] is non-authoritative
  + an LLM may propose rationale identify missing edges or challenge a review
  + model output retains model job prompt context and output provenance when used
  + no model alone supplies human review identity cryptographic signature or Observer admission
  + disagreement between model suggestions and source evidence remains visible

& [ReviewDeterminism] is normalized
  + exact lexical case claim edge faculty and dissent order
  + no timestamp inside normative digest payload although external receipt provenance may record time outside identity
  + identical reviewed inputs and dispositions produce identical canonical payload bytes
  + diagnostics commentary and private reasoning are excluded from normative identity

& [Limits] are exact before activation
  + cases receipts claim witnesses coverage edges faculty receipts dissent records successors batches references rationale characters and envelope bytes
  + every counter product join and dependency traversal uses checked arithmetic
  + limit exhaustion leaves subjects unreviewed and blocks admission

& [FutureOutput] is documentary authority candidate
  + reviewed case catalogue expectation receipts claim receipts coverage receipts faculty receipts cross envelopes dissent ledger Observer disposition accounts and digest
  + no actual reader result report pass compatibility admission provider model service effect production or hardware result

& [AuthorityExclusion] is absolute
  - never: concrete review issuance digital key creation corpus execution reader semantic invocation compatibility certification authority admission provider model service persistence network effect production hardware FPGA or shared inference

& [RequestedDisposition] is preserve_then_sjs_then_form_inactive_proof_oracle_review_protocol
